    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An Outback Presents & Chambers Touring Presentation &nbsp; Charlottetown welcomes global comedy superstar Jimmy Carr back to Canada with his brand-new show, Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny — now with a second show added. Catch him live at the Confederation Centre of the Arts on November 20 with performances at 7:00 PM and 9:30 PM. Known worldwide for his lightning-quick wit, dark one-liners, and unmistakable laugh, Jimmy Carr remains one of the most successful and best-selling comedians of all time. He has performed in over 40 countries, sold millions of tickets, and is consistently one of the most streamed stand-ups of the last decade. His most recent tour, Terribly Funny 2.0, broke major touring records — selling over one million tickets and playing 293 shows across 145 cities in a single year.  Following his sold-out Canadian dates in 2023, Jimmy now returns with his fifth and most ambitious Canadian tour yet. Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny will reach more cities across the country than ever before, and Charlottetown is one of the select Atlantic Canada stops on this coast-to-coast run.  About the “Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny” Tour If you like fast-paced, edgy one-liners, then get ready to be happy. Jimmy Carr returns with Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny, a brand-new hour [&hellip;]"
      }
