        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Yesterday: The Magic of the Beatles - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us for an unforgettable journey through the music of the most legendary group of all time — The Beatles. Step aboard this Magical Mystery Tour as we travel from their very first album all the way to the iconic finale of Abbey Road. "
      }
    ],
