        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Introduction to Step and Tap structure and styles (including Reel and Jig for Step an Sow and Fast Tap) all following BATD curriculum. Focus will be on timing, technique and developing confidence. Dates: September 12 – October 17, 2026 Time: 9:15 AM – 10:00 AM Day: Saturday Ages: 6-8 Register Here"
