        "@value": "The Longest Night – A holiday concert with the Stadacona Band of the Royal Canadian Navy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "With special guest Terra Spencer Celebrate the warmth and wonder of the holiday season with the Stadacona Band of the Royal Canadian Navy and acclaimed Nova Scotian singer-songwriter Terra Spencer. This festive concert brings together the rich sound of one of Canada’s premier military bands with Terra’s heartfelt storytelling, wit, and distinctive folk-inspired artistry. Featuring Christmas classics, locally inspired originals, and unique collaborative performances, this heartwarming concert celebrates the joy, wonder, and spirit of the season."
      }
